# Requests for the Visual Studio / VS Code REST client. Start the app first (dotnet run).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5115

### Send a varied batch of requests through every path, then look at the dashboard
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/traffic

### Ask the policy assistant (spans: rewrite, retrieve, rerank, model calls)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assistant/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How long do refunds take once you receive my return?", "region": "global" }

### A question the policies cannot answer (a retrieval miss and an escalation metric)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assistant/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Do you sell gift cards for restaurants?" }

### Chat with the order agent (spans: agent run, tool calls, model calls; tool outcome metrics)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Can I return the speaker from order NW-10252? I've opened it." }

### Stream a response (records time to first token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assistant/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Do you deliver on Saturdays?" }

### Health check: verifies the model endpoint is reachable without sending a prompt
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
